    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>A Man Trap is a reversed repulsor field that draws a target directly down, as though in incredibly high gravity. A Man Trap covers 1 square, and any creature entering the square of a Man Trap is immediately <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Immobilized\" title=\"Immobilized\">Immobilized</a> (unable to move voluntarily). A creature can attempt to break out of a Man Trap as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a>, requiring a DC 40 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> check. It can be deactivated using a remote (treat as a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Portable_Computer\" title=\"Portable Computer\">Portable Computer</a> with an&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>&nbsp;score of 16). </p>",
